Overlay patch 0024: touch scrolling for the port menu (reference 0018's
menu-scroll intent). The shell queues finger scroll deltas
(SohIos_TakeMenuScrollFor, inherited with the Ship of Harkinian port shell); the menu's
scrollable children consume them when the finger is horizontally inside
the child. Mouse-free, so no hover tooltips and no slider side-effects
(reference device feedback: swipes read as hover and even adjusted sliders
via wheel). Four sites in kart's Menu.cpp: search results, sidebar
section, single-column section, multi-column section. __IOS__-only.
NOTE: also contains the quit hunk's sibling file — no; quit is 0020.
Disjoint from 0020 (quit, ~line 672) and 0023 (font clobber, ~line 567).

